{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-appraisal","title":"历史评价与定位","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scholarly-assessment","title":"学术界的评价","url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/scholarly-assessment","wordCount":1715,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"his-place-in-history","title":"他在历史中的地位","url":"/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/his-place-in-history","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 历史评价与定位\n\n在审视了争议之后，本章尝试为费曼给出公允的历史评价：学术界如何看待他的成就与个性，以及他在科学史上应有的地位。\n\n第一篇文档梳理学术界对费曼的多元评价，包括对其科学贡献、教育影响与人格魅力的认识。第二篇文档尝试为他的历史地位作总体定位，把他放在二十世纪物理学的图景中加以衡量。\n"}